// The screen of the trader probe's client half: a region for each question of
// docs/2026-11-11-phase-2a-plan.md. Written by hand: a stand tool, never
// published. Sizes are layout units (one unit is a pixel at 1080 rows).
//
// Every priority is below 100: an ItemPreviewWidget or a PlayerPreviewWidget
// draws only when its own priority and every ancestor's are below 100, or its
// own is exactly 201 (skill dayz-modding, gui-layouts, section 13).
